hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2736","Hazrat Ali (razi Allahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ek Musalman par doosre Musalman ke haq mein aadaab chhe hain: Jab usse milay to usse Salaam dena.\"""""""""""""
"2737","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Momin par doosre momin ke zimme cheezein hain: Jab woh bimaar ho to usay ziyarat karna.\"""""""
"2738","Qutaybah ne hamari taraf riwayat ki, Sufyān ibn ʿUyaynah ne riwayat ki, ʿAmr ibn Dīnār se, Wahb ibn Munabbih se, uske bhai se — aur woh Hammām ibn Munabbih hain — jisne farmāyā:\n\n\Main ne Abū Hurayrah (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhū) se sunā"
"2739","Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke: \nYahoodiyon ke aadat thi ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ki huzoor mein chheenk marte taake unhe yeh du'a mil jaye: \Yarhamukumullah (Allah tum par rahmat kare).\"" \nIsliye Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Yahdikumullahu wa yuslihu balakum (Allah tumhe hidayat de aur tumhare umoor theek kare).\"""""""
"2740","Salim bin Ubaid ne riwayat kiya ke woh kuch logon ke saafar the."
"2741","Abu Ayyub (Razi Allah Anho) rivayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi aaye to usse karein: 'Al-Hamdulillahi 'Ala Kulli Hal (Har haal mein sab hamd Allah ke liye hai).' Aur jo jawab de usse karein: 'Yarhamukallah (Allah tum par rahmat karein).' Aur usse karein: 'Yahdikumullah Wa Yuslihu Balakum (Allah tumhe hidayat de aur tumhare mamalat theek karein).'\"""""""
"2742","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hain ki do aadmiyan Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ki huzoor mein aachhi kar di aur un mein se ek ki aachhi ka unhon ne jawab diya, lekin doosri ki aachhi ka jawab nahi diya. Jis aadmi ki aachhi ka jawab nahi gaya, us ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah (ﷺ)! Tum ne is aadmi ki aachhi ka jawab diya"
"2743","Iyas bin Salamah ki rivayat hai, unke father (ﷺ) se: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki dargah mein ek aadmi ne aansoo (chheenk) ki"
"2744","Abu Hurairah (radhiyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jis shakhs ne hidayat ki taraf da'wat diya"
"2745","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko jab chheenk aati thi to apney haath sey ya apney kapdey sey munh dhanp letey, aur apni aawaz ko dheemi kartey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2746","Abu Horaira (raziyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Chakh (aksar) Allah ki taraf se hai aur jaag (yawn) Ash-Shaitan ki taraf se. Pas jab tum mein se kisi ko jaag aaye"
"2747","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ki hansana ko pasand farmata hai aur usko qaih (jama' qaih) se nafrat hai. Pas jab tum mein se koi hansaye aur 'Al-Hamdulillah' (sab tareef Allah hi ke liye hai) kahe"
"2748","Muslim ibn Hatim al-Ansari al-Basri ne hum se rivayat kiya; Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Ansari ne hum se rivayat kiya, apne walid se, Ali ibn Zayd se, Saeed ibn al-Musayyab se, ke Anas ibn Malik ne kaha: Rasoolullah ﷺ ne mujhse farmaya: ""Ya bunayya! Agar tu qadir ho ke subah aur shaam ko aise guzare ke tere dil mein kisi ke liye ghash (dhokha/fareeb) na ho, to kar."" Phir farmaya: ""Ya bunayya! Ye meri Sunnat se hai. Jo meri Sunnat ko zinda kare usne mujhse muhabbat ki. Aur jisne mujhse muhabbat ki wo mere saath Jannat mein hoga."" Is hadith mein ek lambi kahani bhi hai. Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith is tareeq se hasan gharib hai. Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Ansari thiqa (bharose ke qabil) hain, unke walid bhi thiqa hain. Ali ibn Zayd saduq (sachche) hain, magar kabhi kabhi wo cheez ko rafa' kar dete hain jo ghair usay waqf karta hai. Aur maine Muhammad ibn Bashshar ko sunte hue paya ke Abu al-Walid ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hum se Ali ibn Zayd se rivayat kiya, aur wo raafi' (rafi' karne wala) the. Hum Saeed ibn al-Musayyab ki Anas se koi aur riwayat nahi jante is hadith ke siwa iski tool (lambai) ke saath. Aur Abbad ibn Maymun al-Minqari ne ye hadith Ali ibn Zayd se Anas se rivayat kiya, aur usme Saeed ibn al-Musayyab ka zikr nahi kiya. Abu Isa ne farmaya: Maine is baare mein Muhammad ibn Ismail se guftagu ki, to unhonne isay nahi pehchana. Saeed ibn al-Musayyab ki Anas se ye hadith ya koi aur hadith ma'lum nahi. Anas ibn Malik 93 Hijri mein wafat pae, aur Saeed ibn al-Musayyab unke do saal baad 95 Hijri mein wafat pae."
"2749","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Kisi ek tumhare bhai ko uski jagah se mat utaaro"
"2750","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Koi tum mein se apne bhai ki jagah se usay khada na karke phir khud us mein baith jaye.\"""""""
"2751","Wahb bin Hudaifah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aik aadmi ko apni jagah ka zyada haq hai. Agar woh apni kisi zaroorat se chala jaye to...\"""""""
"2752","Abdullah bin Amr (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kisi aadmi ke liye yeh jaiz nahi hai ke do afraad ke darmiyan"
"2753","Abu Miljaz ne riwayat ki ke ek aadmi ek halqa ke darmiyan baith gaya. Toh Hudhaifah (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Muhammad (صلی اللہ علیہ"""""
"2754","Hazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \an kay nzdyk kwyy shkhs rswl allh ﷺ say zyadh mhbwb nhyn tha۔\"""" (anhwn nay kha:) \""""awr jb wh aap ﷺ kw dykhtay tw khray nhyn hwtay thay، kywnkh wh jantay thay kh aap ﷺ asay napsnd frmatay hyn۔\"""""""""""""
"2755","Abu Miljaz ne riwayat ki ke Mu'awiyah (radi Allahu anho) nikle aur Abdullah bin Az-Zubair aur Ibn Safwan ne unke liye khade ho gaye jab unhone unhe dekha."
"2756","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Paanch cheezein Fitrah se hain: Pubic baal kaatna.\"""""""
"2757","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Dus (aadat) Fitrah se hain: Moonchh ka chhota karna.\"""""""
"2758","Abu Hurairah (radiyAllahu 'anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Us Zaat ki Qasam jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai"
"2759","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ nay hmaray lyay mwnhyn trashnay ka wqt mqrr frmaya۔\"""""""
"2760","Hadīth kā Tarjumah (ʿIlmī Urdū mein)\n\nAbū Sa'īd (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) se riwāyat hai:\n\nAbū Mūsā (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ne ʿUmar (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ke hāẓirī kī ijāzat māṅgī. Unhoṅ ne kahā: \As-salāmu ʿalaykum — kyā maiṅ andar ā'ūṅ?\"" ʿUmar (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) ne farmāyā: \""Yeh ek bār hai.\"" Phir kuch der sukūn se ruk gaye aur dubārā kahā: \""As-salāmu ʿalaykum — kyā maiṅ andar ā'ūṅ?\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Yeh do bār hai.\"" Phir kuch der sukūn se ruk gaye aur kahā: \""As-salāmu ʿalaykum — kyā maiṅ andar ā'ūṅ?\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Yeh tīn bār hai.\"" Phir Abū Mūsā (Raz̤ī Allāhu ʿAnhu) muṛ kar wāpas chalē ga'e. ʿUmar ne darbān se pūchhā: \""Unhoṅ ne kyā kiyā?\"" Usne jawāb diyā: \""Woh wāpas chalē ga'e.\"" ʿUmar ne farmāyā: \""Use mere pās lāo.\"" Jab woh ā'e"
"2761","Zaid bin Arqam (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \js nay apny mwnchh say nhyn lya...\"""""""
"2762","Abu Hurayrah (radiyAllahu 'anhu) rivayat karte hain:\n\nEk shakhs masjid mein dakhil hai jabke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) masjid ke ek kone mein baithe the. Us shakhs ne namaz ada phir aake unhe salam pher diya. Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Wa 'alaykum. Wapas jao aur namaz padho"
"2763","Hazrat Ibn 'Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \mwndhy kw chhwta krw awr darhy kw brhnay dw۔\"""""""
"2764","Ibn Umar (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay mwnchhyn ktrnay ka awr darhy brhanay ka hkm frmaya۔"
"2765","Qutaybah ne ham se riwayat ki, Ibn Luḥayʿah ne ham se riwayat ki, ʿAmr ibn Shuʿayb ne apne baap se riwayat ki, aur unke baap ne apne dada se riwayat ki, aur unke dada ne Rasool Allah ﷺ se riwayat ki ke Aap ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n\Woh ham mein se nahi jo doosron ki tashabbuh kare. Yahoodiyon aur Nasaron ki tashabbuh na karo"
"2766","Jabir (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Ishtimal As-Samma (kapde ko sirf ek taraf se lapet kar pehne) se mana farmaya.\"""""""
"2767","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Ishtimal As-Samma (kapron ko sir se lekar pair tak ek taraf se lapet kar pehne ki) se mana farmaya.\"""""""
"2768","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ek aadmi ko apne pet par pada dekha, to farmaya: \Beshak yeh tariqa Allah ko pasand nahi hai.\"""""""
"2769","Baz bin Hakim ne riwayat ki ke mere baap ne mere dada se riwayat ki."
"2770","Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\nmyn nay rswl allh ﷺ kw ayk tkyh ya balsh pr tyk lga kr jhkay hwyay dykha۔"
"2771","Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\nmyn nay nby krym (ﷺ) kw tkyh lga kr tyk lgayay hwyay dykha۔"
"2772","Abu Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \ksy shkhs kw as kay aqtdar myn amamt nhyn ky ja skty۔\"""""""
"2773","Abdullah bin Buraidah ne riwayat ki: \Main ne apne walid Buraidah ko kehte suna: 'Main Nabi (ﷺ) ke saath chal raha tha ke ek aadmi ek gadha lekar aaya...'\"""""""
"2774","Jabir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \kya tmharay pas anmt (kpray) hyn؟\"" myn nay kha: \""hmyn anmt khan say mlyn gay؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""jld hy tmharay pas anmt hwn gay۔\"" jabr (rz all an) nay kha: \""myn apny bywy say khta: 'apnay kpray myry nzr say hta dw۔' wh khty: 'kya rswl allh (ﷺ) nay nhyn frmaya tha kh jld hy tmharay pas anmt hwn gay؟'\"" anhwn nay kha: \""tw myn nay asay chhwr dya۔\"""""""
"2775","Iyaas bin Salamah ne apni taraf se riwaayat ki, aur unke baap ne farmaya ke: \Main ne Allah ke Nabi (ﷺ) aur Hasan aur Husain (رضي الله عنهم) ko sawaar ki.\"""""""
"2776","Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne rivayat kiya ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se be-ghalat nazar (unintentional glance) ke bare mein poocha."
"2777","Ibn Buraidah ne apni taraf se riwayat ki, jo apne baap se rawaiyya ke zariye Nabi Kareem ﷺ se naql farmate hain ke: \Ya Ali! Ek nazar ke baad doosri nazar mat karo.\"""""""
"2778","Nabhan, Umm Salamah ke azaad karda ghulaam ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat ki:"
"2779","Dhakwan ne riwayat ki, jo Amr bin Al-'As ki laundi thi, ke Amr bin Al-'As ne unhein Ali (radi Allahu anhu) ke paas bheja ke un se Asma bint Umais (radi Allahu anha) ke paas dakhil hone ki ijazat maangein."
"2780","Sufyān ibn Wakīʿ ne rawāyat kī, Rawḥ ibn ʿUbādah ne rawāyat kī, Ibn Jurayj se, ʿAmr ibn Abī Sufyān ne mujhe ittilāʿ dī ki ʿAmr ibn ʿAbdullāh ibn Ṣafwān ne mujhe ittilāʿ dī ki Kaladah ibn Ḥanbal ne mujhe ittilāṉ dī ki Ṣafwān ibn Umayyah ne mujhe doodh, chote ūṅṭ ke gosht aur *ḍaghābīs* ke sath Nabī ﷺ ke pās bhejā, jabki Nabī ﷺ wādī ke ūparī hissé meṉ the. Kaladah ne kahā: \Main un ke pās salām bheje baghair aur ijāzat māṅge baghair dākhil ho gayā. Nabī ﷺ ne farmayā: 'Wapas jāo aur kaho: *As-salāmu ʿalaykum"
"2781","Humaid bin Abdur-Rahman ne riwayat ki ke unhon ne Muawiyah (رضي الله عنه) ko Madina Munawwara mein khutba detay huay suna."
"2782","Hazrat Abdullah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne woh auraton par la'nat bhejti hain jo khud ko ghaleez nishaan (tattoo) karwati hain aur jo ghaleez nishaan karwati hain."
"2783","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ki laanat hai us par jis apna baal lambi karti hai aur us par jis apne baal lambwaati hain.\"""""""
"2784","Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ nay an awrtwn pr lant bhyjy jw mrdwn ky nql krty hyn awr an mrdwn pr lant bhyjy jw awrtwn ky nql krtay hyn۔\"""""""
"2785","Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh ﷺ nay an mrdwn pr lant bhyjy jw awrtwn jysay bn jatay hyn awr an awrtwn pr bhy jn ka chal chln mrdwn jysa hw۔\"""""""
"2786","Abu Musa (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \hr aankh zna krty hay۔\"""""""
"2787","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mard ke liye khushboo woh hai jiski khushboo zaahir ho aur uska rang chhupa ho.\"""""""
"2788","Imran bin Husain (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bay shk mrdwn kay lyay bhtryn khwshbw wh hay js ky khwshbw zahr hw awr as ka rng pwshydh hw۔\"""""""
"2789","Thumamah bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke: Anas (رضي الله عنه) khushboo ko kabhi inkar nahi karte the."
"2790","Ibn 'Umar (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \tyn chyzyn aysy hyn jw rd nhyn ky jatyn: tkyay...\"""""""
"2791","Abu 'Uthman An-Nahdi (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi ko khusboo (khushbu) di jaye to use na karne na kiyo.\"""""""
"2792","Abdullah (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiye ki Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aurat ko kisi aur aurat ko is tarah chhuna nahi chahiye ke woh uske shohar ko us aurat ka is tarah bayan kar sake jaise ke woh usay dekh raha ho.\"""""""
"2793","Hazrat Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Sa'eed (Khudri) (rz all anh) nay apnay bap say rwayt ky hay kh anhwn nay frmaya:\n\n\rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: 'ksy mrd kw ksy dwsray mrd ky awrt (awrt ka hsh) dykhnay ky ajazt nhyn hay۔'\"""""""
"2794","Masjid Mein Dakhil Honay Walay Teen Ādmī Kā Hadīth\n\nAbū Wāqid al-Laithī (Raziyallāhu Anhu) se riwāyat hai:\n\nRasūlullāh (ﷺ) ek dafa masjid mein apne ḥuzūr mein baithay huay thay aur Ṣaḥābah (Raziyallāhu Anhum) ḥalqe mein mojūd thay. Ān par teen ādmī ā gayay. Un mein se do Rasūlullāh (ﷺ) ke ḥuzūr mein ā gayay aur unhe salām kiyā, jabke teesrā wāpis chalā gayā aur ruk gayā.\n\nUn do ādmīyon mein se awwal ne ḥalqe mein ek jagah khālī dekhī aur us mein baith gayā. Dūsrā unke pīchay baith gayā. Teesrā wāpis muṛ gayā aur chalā gayā.\n\nJab Rasūlullāh (ﷺ) ne (muqarrar kaam) pūrā kiyā, to farmāyā:\n\n\Kiyā tumhe batāūn tīn ādmīyon ke bāre mein? Un mein se ek ne Allāh se panāh māngī"
"2795","Zur'ah bin Muslim bin Jardah Al-Aslami ne riwayat kiya, uske dada Jarhad (radiyallahu anhu) ke zarye':"
